      <title>A look at Wyoming’s balanced budget requirement</title>
      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/open-spaces/2026-03-02/a-look-at-wyomings-balanced-budget-requirement</link>
      <description>Wyoming, like the majority of states, is required to pass a balanced budget. Volatile revenues, the lack of an income tax and working on a two-year cycle all present challenges, according to a researcher with the Urban Institute.</description>
